---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | ISO 37001"
  description="ISO 37001 anti-bribery certification for social audits - strengthen business integrity and demonstrate anti-corruption compliance to clients."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/social-audits/iso-37001/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783918031/iso37001_ohhsow.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 37001 Anti-Bribery Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Anti-Bribery Management Systems for Ethical Business Conduct</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ISO 37001  -  Anti-Bribery Management</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Prevent, detect, and respond to bribery with a certified management system.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Anti-Bribery Management  -  <span class="text-euro-600">ISO 37001</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 37001 specifies requirements and provides guidance for establishing, implementing, maintaining, reviewing, and improving an anti-bribery management system. It is designed to help organizations prevent, detect, and respond to bribery.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">It covers direct and indirect bribery, by or on behalf of the organization, by the organization&#x27;s personnel or business associates. Applicable to all organizations regardless of type, size, or activity.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-industry text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Key Elements</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">ISO 37001 addresses bribery prevention, risk assessment, due diligence, financial controls, whistleblowing mechanisms, and anti-corruption culture  -  providing a comprehensive framework for ethical business conduct.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367901/eurocert/b12.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 37001 Anti-Bribery Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of ISO 37001 <span class="text-euro-600">Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-ban text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 37001 certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Globally recognized certification for anti-bribery management systems.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sitemap text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Anti-bribery management system</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive framework to prevent, detect, and respond to bribery.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-search text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Bribery risk assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Identify and evaluate bribery risks across your organization.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Compliance verification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Independent verification of anti-bribery compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-user-check text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Due diligence procedures</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Robust due diligence for personnel and business associates.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-coins text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Financial controls implementation</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Implement financial controls to prevent bribery.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-bullhorn text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Whistleblowing mechanisms</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Secure channels for reporting suspected bribery.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group text-center"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 mx-auto group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Anti-corruption culture building</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Foster an organizational culture of integrity and transparency.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Certify with Eurocert?</h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">About Eurocert</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body. Through this affiliation, clients benefit from internationally recognised accreditation, a worldwide footprint, and highly trained auditors with deep expertise in anti-bribery management systems, ISO 37001"aligned conformity assessment and related assurance.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Our Expertise</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Eurocert has earned recognition by conducting anti-bribery audits and ISO 37001 certifications for well-known companies for many years.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed font-medium">Certification by Eurocert means evaluation and acceptance by an accredited and well-respected third-party professional organization.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 mt-8 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><p class="text-white/60 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-eurogold-400 font-bold">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A</span>  -  a Pan-European Certification body operating from Athens with global reach.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">ACCREDITED</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font"><a href="/accreditations/" class="hover:text-eurogold-400 transition-colors">Independent Third-Party Audits</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/iso-26000/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367896/eurocert/b11.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">ISO 26000</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Social Responsibility</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/sa-8000/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367884/eurocert/b1.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">SA 8000</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Social Accountability</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/code-of-conduct/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367916/eurocert/b3.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Code of Conduct</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Brand Audits</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-10 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-3 font-bold">Get Certified</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Quick Inquiry</h2><p class="text-white/45 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">Our anti-bribery experts are ready to guide your organization through ISO 37001 certification.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get Started <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a href="tel:+919316012883" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-phone text-[9px]"></i> Call Us Now</a></div></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
